This is a brief list of all the files in meta-virtualization/docs and what
they contain. If you add a documentation file, please list it here in
alphabetical order as well.

00-INDEX
        - this file.

00-README
        - info on the goals of meta-virtualization and this docs subdir

container-bundling.md
	- container bundling, cross-install, and vdkr/vpdmn documentation.

openvswitch.txt
	- example on how to setup openvswitch with qemu/kvm.

podman.txt
	- documentation on podman container engine integration.

vxn.md
	- vxn architecture, interfaces, CLI usage, guest-side init, nested
	  enforcement, sub-packages, and debugging reference.

vxn-host-binary.md
	- running an ordinary host binary inside a vxn DomU: dependency
	  closure carry, direct-mount rootfs, interactive workflow.

vxn-sdk.md
	- how to build a vxn SDK (Docker-for-Xen, containers as Xen DomU) from Yocto.

xvisor.txt
	- example on how to setup Xvisor for RISC-V QEMU.
